---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const portraitSrc = `${base}images/jason-portrait-window-896.webp`;
const projectsHref = `${base}projects/`;
---

<BaseLayout
  editorial
  title="About Jason Lyvers"
  description="Jason Lyvers is a digital marketing strategist and curious generalist who cares about useful, accurate information."
>
  <Navigation />

  <main class="about-preview">
    <div class="page-shell">
      <header class="about-intro">
        <figure class="portrait-placement">
          <img
            src={portraitSrc}
            alt="Jason smiling in a warm room by a window."
            width="896"
            height="1120"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>

        <div class="intro-copy">
          <h1>Hi, I’m <span class="about-name">Jason.<svg class="about-title-star" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 0 10 6 16 8 10 10 8 16 6 10 0 8 6 6Z" /></svg></span></h1>
          <p class="intro-lead">I’m a digital marketing strategist, which is the tidy answer. The less tidy answer is that I’m a generalist with a curiosity that rarely stays in its lane.</p>
          <p>I’ve worked in marketing for more than a decade. For the past three-ish years, I’ve been helping a local cremation provider become easier to find online.</p>
          <p>People looking for funeral or cremation information may be grieving and under time pressure. A wrong fact can cost a family money or time, so I care a lot about getting the answer right and making it easy to understand.</p>
          <p>The site gives the rest of my attention somewhere to go: books, philosophy, creativity, odd connections, and whatever has sent me down the latest rabbit hole.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="about-sequence" aria-label="About Jason Lyvers">
        <section aria-labelledby="thinking-title">
          <p class="sequence-number" aria-hidden="true">01<span class="section-glint glint-one" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
          <div>
            <h2 id="thinking-title">How I think</h2>
            <p>My interests show up in little bursts of rabbit holes. I’ll get hooked on a question, follow it into neighboring subjects, and come back later when something pulls me in again.</p>
            <p>I like taking an idea from one place and putting it next to something from somewhere else to see if they make each other better. A connection can turn into something useful, or show me exactly where my thinking broke.</p>
            <p>I’m interested in what other people think and why they see things the way they do. I like conversations where someone can change their mind or leave with a better question.</p>
            <p>Either one counts.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="work-title">
          <p class="sequence-number" aria-hidden="true">02<span class="section-glint glint-two" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
          <div>
            <h2 id="work-title">How I work</h2>
            <p>Most marketing advice starts with a tactic. I usually want to back up a step.</p>
            <p>Who is this for? What are they trying to understand? What evidence do we have, and what would make the answer more useful?</p>
            <p>Those questions shape how I work on websites and search. They also shape how I think about content that may appear in AI-generated answers.</p>
            <p>AI is part of my process. I use it to research, compare sources, test ideas, and pressure-check writing. Two models can agree and still be wrong. I still read the work, check the links, and verify the claims. The final judgment stays with the person whose name is on the work.</p>
            <p>LinkedIn has the dates and job titles, because someone ought to keep them in order.</p>
            <p class="preview-link-label"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonlyvers/">View my experience on LinkedIn</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="selected-work-title">
          <p class="sequence-number" aria-hidden="true">03<span class="section-glint glint-three" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
          <div>
            <h2 id="selected-work-title">Selected work</h2>
            <p>The projects here will be specific about what I contributed, who else was involved, and what the evidence supports. Good work is usually shared work, and every public result needs a source I can stand behind.</p>
            <p class="section-action"><a href={projectsHref}>Explore selected projects</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="connect-title">
          <p class="sequence-number" aria-hidden="true">04<span class="section-glint glint-four" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
          <div>
            <h2 id="connect-title">Connect</h2>
            <p>I like good questions, useful disagreements, unexpected common ground, and work worth thinking through.</p>
            <p>Send me an email if something here makes you want to compare notes or talk about a project. You can also find me on LinkedIn.</p>
            <p>No pitch required.</p>
            <div class="preview-actions" aria-label="Contact links">
              <a class="preview-link-label" href="mailto:jasonalyvers@gmail.com">Email Jason</a>
              <a class="preview-link-label" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonlyvers/">Find me on LinkedIn</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="about-footer">
    <p>Built from the open-source <a href="https://github.com/kpab/astro-darkness">Darkness Astro theme</a> by kpab.</p>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-preview,
  .about-footer {
    width: min(100% - 2rem, 1120px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-preview {
    min-height: calc(100svh - 108px);
    padding: clamp(8.5rem, 15vh, 10rem) 0 clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about-intro {
    max-width: 1000px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 352px) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.4vw, 4.8rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  .about-name {
    position: relative;
    color: #d6b477;
  }

  .about-title-star,
  .section-glint {
    position: absolute;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    offset-position: auto;
    offset-anchor: left top;
    offset-rotate: 0deg;
    offset-distance: 0%;
  }

  .about-title-star {
    width: 0.18em;
    height: 0.18em;
    right: 0.03em;
    top: -0.25em;
    overflow: visible;
    fill: #d6b477;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3px rgba(214, 180, 119, 0.35));
    opacity: 0.72;
    offset-path: path('M0 0 C4 -3 8 -3 8 0 C8 3 4 3 0 0 C-4 -3 -8 -3 -8 0 C-8 3 -4 3 0 0 Z');
    animation: about-wander 18s linear infinite,
      about-title-shimmer 19s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: -4s, -7s;
  }

  .intro-copy {
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .intro-copy p {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .intro-copy .intro-lead {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0;
    color: #ded2c1;
    font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.6vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .portrait-placement {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .portrait-placement img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 352px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .about-sequence {
    margin-top: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5.75rem);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(205, 170, 112, 0.2);
  }

  .about-sequence section {
    min-height: 180px;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(46px, 0.18fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(205, 170, 112, 0.16);
  }

  .sequence-number {
    margin: 0;
    position: relative;
    color: #8f785c;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .section-glint {
    width: 5.5px;
    height: 5.5px;
    left: 2.6rem;
    top: 0.14rem;
    background: #d6b477;
    clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 63% 37%, 100% 50%, 63% 63%, 50% 100%, 37% 63%, 0 50%, 37% 37%);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(214, 180, 119, 0.42));
    opacity: 0.46;
  }

  .glint-one {
    offset-path: path('M0 0 C4 -2 10 -2 14 1 C10 4 4 3 0 0 Z');
    animation: about-wander 17s linear infinite,
      about-glint-shimmer 13s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: -3s, -1s;
  }

  .glint-two {
    offset-path: path('M0 0 C-4 2 -9 3 -12 0 C-8 -3 -3 -2 0 0 Z');
    animation: about-wander 21s linear infinite,
      about-glint-shimmer 17s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: -11s, -7s;
  }

  .glint-three {
    offset-path: path('M0 0 C5 3 12 2 16 -1 C12 -4 5 -3 0 0 Z');
    animation: about-wander 19s linear infinite,
      about-glint-shimmer 15s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: -6s, -12s;
  }

  .glint-four {
    offset-path: path('M0 0 C-3 -3 -8 -2 -10 1 C-7 4 -2 3 0 0 Z');
    animation: about-wander 23s linear infinite,
      about-glint-shimmer 19s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: -17s, -4s;
  }

  @keyframes about-wander {
    from { offset-distance: 0%; }
    to { offset-distance: 100%; }
  }

  @keyframes about-title-shimmer {
    0%, 34%, 78%, 100% { opacity: 0.64; }
    56% { opacity: 0.84; }
  }

  @keyframes about-glint-shimmer {
    0%, 38%, 82%, 100% { opacity: 0.35; }
    58% { opacity: 0.72; }
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.4rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about-sequence section > div > p {
    max-width: 64ch;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .preview-link-label {
    color: #ccb184 !important;
    font-size: 0.78rem !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .preview-link-label a,
  a.preview-link-label {
    color: inherit;
    text-underline-offset: 0.24rem;
  }

  .preview-actions {
    margin-top: 1.35rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
  }

  .preview-actions .preview-link-label {
    margin: 0;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .section-action a {
    color: #ccb184;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-underline-offset: 0.24rem;
  }

  .about-footer {
    padding: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(205, 170, 112, 0.15);
    color: #a9a093;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .about-footer p {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-footer a {
    color: #ccb184;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 721px) and (min-height: 840px) {
    .glint-three { animation-play-state: paused; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about-preview,
    .about-footer {
      width: min(100% - 1.5rem, 1120px);
    }

    .about-preview {
      min-height: auto;
      padding-top: 7.3rem;
      padding-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .about-intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 14vw, 4rem); }

    .about-title-star {
      width: 0.15em;
      height: 0.15em;
      top: -0.22em;
    }

    .section-glint {
      width: 4.5px;
      height: 4.5px;
      left: 0.95rem;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(214, 180, 119, 0.38));
    }

    .glint-one { offset-path: path('M0 0 C3 -1 6 -2 8 1 C6 3 2 2 0 0 Z'); }
    .glint-two { offset-path: path('M0 0 C-2 2 -5 2 -7 0 C-5 -2 -2 -2 0 0 Z'); }
    .glint-three { offset-path: path('M0 0 C3 2 7 2 10 -1 C7 -3 3 -2 0 0 Z'); }
    .glint-four { offset-path: path('M0 0 C-2 -2 -6 -2 -8 1 C-6 3 -2 2 0 0 Z'); }

    .portrait-placement {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .portrait-placement img {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 380px;
      height: auto;
    }

    .about-sequence { margin-top: 3.2rem; }

    .about-sequence section {
      min-height: 0;
      grid-template-columns: 34px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 8vw, 2.35rem); }

    .about-footer {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .about-title-star,
    .section-glint {
      animation: none;
      transform: none;
      offset-path: none;
      offset-distance: 0%;
    }

    .about-title-star { opacity: 0.58; }
    .section-glint { opacity: 0.38; }
  }
</style>
